 Command line input:
 $ crest complex.xyz --gfn2 --mquick --noreftopo --chrg 0 --uhf 0 -T 2

  --gfn2               : Use of GFN2-xTB requested.
  --mquick  : very crude quick-mode (no NORMMD, no GC, crude opt.)
  --chrg 0
  --uhf 0
  -T 2 (CPUs/Threads selected)

